    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0681" n="593" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg593"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Newberry to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1892</hi></date>. (Received September 29.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 544.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatches numbered 526 and
                    536, respectively, I beg to inclose herewith a copy of a letter received
                    herefrom Dr. Bowen, from which it will be seen that all trouble at Alachan is
                    over with.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. R. Newberry</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires ad interim</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d471-a1.xml" xpointer="d471-a1"/>
            </div>
